            0.621
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "一、填空（共20分，每空1分）。"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.65,
            0.827,
            0.796
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.65,
                0.427,
                0.666
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 蛋白质中的氨基酸均是____。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.668,
                0.801,
                0.684
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 利用____氨基酸在____有强的光吸收，可测定溶液中这些氨基酸的浓度。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.687,
                0.565,
                0.703
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 环状 DNA 的存在状态主要有____和____。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.706,
                0.457,
                0.721
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 碱基与戊糖间 C-C 连接的是____。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.724,
                0.825,
                0.74
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. 代谢物在细胞内的生物氧化与在体外燃烧的主要区别是____、____和____。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.743,
                0.663,
                0.759
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6. 绿色植物生成 ATP 的三种方式是____、____和____。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.761,
                0.783,
                0.777
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7. 丙酮酸脱氢酶系包括____、____和____三种酶和____种辅助因子。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.78,
                0.682,
                0.796
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8. 脂肪酸的主要合成原料有____、____、____和____。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.825,
            0.434,
            0.843
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "二、选择题（共10分,每题1分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.854,
            0.803,
            0.907
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.854,
                0.393,
                0.869
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 下列哪一项不是辅酶的功能?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 17,
              "bbox": [
                0.16,
                0.872,
                0.803,
                0.889
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "a 转移基团 b 传递氢 c 传递电子 d 某些物质分解代谢时的载体 e 决定酶的专一性"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 18,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.891,
                0.569,
                0.907
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 有机磷农药作为酶的抑制剂是作用于酶活性中心的:"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.094,
            0.467,
            0.109
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a 疏基 b 羟基 c 羧基 d 咪唑基 e 氨基"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.113,
            0.463,
            0.128
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 完全食肉的人，可能缺乏的维生素是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.131,
            0.592,
            0.146
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a 硫胺素 b 维生素 PP c 维生素 B"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "_{12}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " d 泛酸 e 维生素 C"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.149,
            0.553,
            0.165
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. 活细胞不能利用下列哪些能源来维持它们的代谢？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.168,
            0.466,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "aATP b 脂肪 c 糖 d 周围热能 e 阳光"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.187,
            0.305,
            0.202
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. DNA 变性的原因"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.205,
            0.85,
            0.24
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a 温度升高是唯一的原因 b 磷酸二酯键断裂 c 多核苷酸链解聚 d 碱基的甲基化修饰 e 互补碱基之间的氢键断裂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.242,
            0.33,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. 真核生物的 mRNA:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.26,
            0.848,
            0.295
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a 在胞质内合成并发挥其功能 b 帽子结构是一系列的腺苷酸 c 有帽子结构核 Poly A 尾巴 d 因能携带遗传信息，故可长期存在 e 前身是 rRNA"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.298,
            0.498,
            0.313
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. 哺乳动物细胞核糖体的大亚基沉降系数为:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.316,
            0.43,
            0.331
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a30S b 40S c60S d70S e80S"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.335,
            0.668,
            0.351
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. 某种酶活性需以—SH 为必需基团，能保护其不被氧化的物质是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.354,
            0.53,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "aCys bGSH c 尿素 d 离子型去污剂 e 乙醇"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.372,
            0.463,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. 从组织中提取酶时，最理想的结果是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.39,
            0.81,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a 蛋白产量最高 b 酶活力单位数值很大 c 比活力最高 dKm 值最小 e 转换数最高"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.409,
            0.402,
            0.424
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. 生物素参与下列哪一种反应?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.427,
            0.642,
            0.443
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a 羟化作用 b 羧化作用 c 脱羧作用 d 脱水作用 e 脱氨作用"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.473,
            0.569,
            0.492
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "三、判断是(√)非(×)题（每题1分，共20分）。"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.502,
            0.389,
            0.517
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 亮氨酸疏水性比缬氨酸要强。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.52,
            0.409,
            0.536
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 蛋白质变性后，其分子量变小。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.539,
            0.458,
            0.555
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 胶原纤维蛋白主要结构是  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta-"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  折叠片。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.557,
            0.605,
            0.573
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. 用二苯胺法测定 DNA，必须用同源的 DNA 作为标准样。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.576,
            0.576,
            0.591
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. RNA 的分子组成中，通常 A 不等于 U，G 不等于 C。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.595,
            0.391,
            0.61
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. 酶影响它所催化反应的平衡。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.613,
            0.479,
            0.628
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. 酶促反应的米氏常数与所有的底物无关。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.631,
            0.567,
            0.647
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. 固定化酶的一个缺点就是很难作用于水不溶性底物。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.65,
            0.377,
            0.665
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. 维生素 K 是水溶性维生素。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.669,
            0.416,
            0.684
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. 长期单食玉米的人易患癞皮病。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 28,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.687,
            0.587,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11. 牛奶应避光保存，以免其所含的维生素 B2 遭到破坏。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 29,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.706,
            0.514,
            0.721
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "12. 2,4-二硝基苯酚是氧化磷酸化的解偶联剂。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 30,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.724,
            0.506,
            0.74
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "13. 糖酵解关键的酶是醛缩酶，催化单向反应。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 31,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.743,
            0.558,
            0.758
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "14. 抗脂解激素有胰高血糖素，肾上腺素和甲状腺素。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 32,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.761,
            0.698,
            0.777
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "15. 因胆固醇为两性分子，作为生物膜的主要成分，可调节膜的流动性。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 33,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.78,
            0.663,
            0.795
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "16. 除乳糜微粒外，其它血浆脂蛋白主要是在肝脏或血浆中合成的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 34,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.798,
            0.483,
            0.813
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "17. RNA 转录是以 DNA 为模板合成 RNA。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 35,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.816,
            0.662,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "18. PCR 技术所用的引物是待扩增的 DNA 区段 3' 端的互补序列。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 36,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.835,
            0.628,
            0.851
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "19. 在水溶液中，蛋白质分子表面的氢原子相互作用形成氢键。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 37,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.854,
            0.349,
            0.869
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "20. 抗体就是免疫球蛋白。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.102,
            0.581,
            0.121
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "四、名词解释及问答题（每小题5分，共50分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.168,
            0.848,
            0.388
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 1,
              "bbox": [
